{
  "id": "28290_noseru",
  "headword": "{載|の}せる",
  "reading": "のせる",
  "romaji": "noseru",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (ichidan)",
  "gloss": "to load (cargo); to publish; to post",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to load; to put (cargo) on",
      "explanation": "To place cargo, freight, or goods onto a vehicle, vessel, or surface for transport."
    },
    {
      "sense_number": 2,
      "gloss": "to publish; to print; to post; to carry (an article)",
      "explanation": "To include text, an image, an article, or information in a publication, on a website, or in another medium."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "28290_noseru_ex1",
      "japanese": "トラックに{荷物|にもつ}を{載|の}せた。",
      "english": "I loaded the cargo onto the truck.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "28290_noseru_ex2",
      "japanese": "{船|ふね}に{大量|たいりょう}の{石油|せきゆ}を{載|の}せて{運|はこ}ぶ。",
      "english": "Large quantities of oil are loaded onto ships for transport.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "28290_noseru_ex3",
      "japanese": "{雑誌|ざっし}に{彼|かれ}のインタビューを{載|の}せた。",
      "english": "We published his interview in the magazine.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        2
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "28290_noseru_ex4",
      "japanese": "{写真|しゃしん}をブログに{載|の}せた。",
      "english": "I posted the photo on my blog.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        2
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "28290_noseru_ex5",
      "japanese": "{新聞|しんぶん}は{事件|じけん}の{詳細|しょうさい}を{大|おお}きく{載|の}せた。",
      "english": "The newspaper gave the incident large coverage.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        2
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "28290_noseru_ex6",
      "japanese": "{自分|じぶん}の{名前|なまえ}がリストに{載|の}せられているのを{見|み}て{驚|おどろ}いた。",
      "english": "I was surprised to see my own name listed.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        2
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Kanji variant of {乗|の}せる. Use {載|の}せる when the action is about loading cargo for transport or publishing/posting content; use {乗|の}せる for putting people in vehicles or placing things on surfaces in general.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {新聞|しんぶん}に{載|の}せる: to print in a newspaper\n- {雑誌|ざっし}に{載|の}せる: to publish in a magazine\n- ホームページに{載|の}せる: to post on a website\n- {船|ふね}に{載|の}せる: to load onto a ship\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {乗|の}せる: to put on; to give a ride — general placement, not cargo or publishing\n- {掲載|けいさい}する: to publish; to carry — more formal, used for official publications",
